"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"In the distant future, mankind is forced to live in domed cities called Domepolis after an environmental cataclysm. These cities are maintained and supplied by private corporations, but at what cost to the inhabitants living within them? In a Siberian Domepolis, virtual game champion Gainer Sanga is arrested on suspicion of Exodus, an unauthorized venture beyond the dome walls and strictly prohibited by the government.\n\nIn prison, he meets Gain Bijou, a mercenary bent on escaping and together the two will steal a mysterious Overman out of Duke Medaiyu's mansion. Fighting back the Siberian Railway Patrol forces, they both lead a massive Exodus out of the city to the east land Yapan, where their ancestors are originally from.\n\n(Source: Bandai Entertainment)"},"tags":[{"name":"Politics","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Snowscape","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Stop Motion","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Robot","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"OVERMAN King Gainer","english":null,"native":"OVERMANキングゲイナー","romaji":"OVERMAN King Gainer","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"返乡战士"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"帝皇战纪"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"极限战士"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"オーバーマン キングゲイナー"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Overman"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"完蛋人"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}